<section class="gb-hero"><div class="gb-hero-bg pxw"><img data-px=".12" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1545697729-0ab8f5b1954c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&h=1100&q=75" alt="glowing light falling across the gears of a watch movement" width="1600" height="1100" fetchpriority="high"></div><div class="gb-w gb-hero-g"><div class="gb-hero-t"><p class="gb-ey"><span></span>Mechanical watches, explained</p><h1><span class="l1">Gear</span><span class="l2">box</span></h1><p class="gb-hero-p">An independent workshop guide to what happens inside a mechanical watch: the springs, wheels and tiny escapement that count every second.</p><div class="gb-hero-a"><a class="gb-btn" href="how-a-movement-works.html">How a movement works</a><a class="gb-lnk" href="#beat">Try the beat visualiser &rarr;</a></div></div><div class="gb-hero-v"><svg class="gb-train" viewBox="0 0 620 560" aria-hidden="true"><g transform="translate(220.0 380.0)"><g data-g="1.0000" data-r0="-40.00" transform="rotate(-40.00)"><path d="M132.7 -5.7 L147.2 -3.4 L147.2 3.4 L132.7 5.7 L132.1 13.3 L146.1 17.6 L145.2 24.3 L130.5 24.5 L128.9 31.9 L142.1 38.2 L140.3 44.7 L125.7 42.8 L123.1 49.9 L135.3 58.1 L132.5 64.2 L118.3 60.3 L114.7 66.9 L125.6 76.7 L122.0 82.4 L108.5 76.5 L104.0 82.6 L113.4 93.8 L109.0 98.9 L96.5 91.2 L91.2 96.5 L98.9 109.0 L93.8 113.4 L82.6 104.0 L76.5 108.5 L82.4 122.0 L76.7 125.6 L66.9 114.7 L60.3 118.3 L64.2 132.5 L58.1 135.3 L49.9 123.1 L42.8 125.7 L44.7 140.3 L38.2 142.1 L31.9 128.9 L24.5 130.5 L24.3 145.2 L17.6 146.1 L13.3 132.1 L5.7 132.7 L3.4 147.2 L-3.4 147.2 L-5.7 132.7 L-13.3 132.1 L-17.6 146.1 L-24.3 145.2 L-24.5 130.5 L-31.9 128.9 L-38.2 142.1 L-44.7 140.3 L-42.8 125.7 L-49.9 123.1 L-58.1 135.3 L-64.2 132.5 L-60.3 118.3 L-66.9 114.7 L-76.7 125.6 L-82.4 122.0 L-76.5 108.5 L-82.6 104.0 L-93.8 113.4 L-98.9 109.0 L-91.2 96.5 L-96.5 91.2 L-109.0 98.9 L-113.4 93.8 L-104.0 82.6 L-108.5 76.5 L-122.0 82.4 L-125.6 76.7 L-114.7 66.9 L-118.3 60.3 L-132.5 64.2 L-135.3 58.1 L-123.1 49.9 L-125.7 42